WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:25.275
After searching through the night for your shattered peace.

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:34.659
After throwing your dawn-lit sorrow into the world.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:44.294
You'll look for my friendly shoulder, 
my embrace, your shelter.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:51.593
You'll scream my name pointlessly in an empty room.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:01:02.103
After having my love for nearly a lifetime.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:10.862
After throwing away a love so true.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.033
It has been a long time since I left.

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:20.288
You used to scream, "I dare you!"

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:26.669
And now you hear my curse whispering in your ear.

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:35.804
You are going to regret treating me like this.

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:43.812
You will spend sleepless nights on an endless pursuit.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:55.240
You are going to regret treating me like this.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:02:02.038
And every drink you have will remind you of me.

00:02:23.059 --> 00:02:24.978
